WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.737
-Rudy Giuliani admitted
in a deposition

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:06.673
that he didn´t try to verify
his insane voter fraud lies,

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.975
and Ted Cruz decided to pick
a fight with Big Bird.

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:11.077
For more on this,
it´s time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:15.148
♫♫

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:17.884
If you have opened Twitter
or flipped past cable news

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:19.119
on your TV in the past week,

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:20.320
you´ve probably heard
that Democrats

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.721
lost an election in Virginia

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:23.957
and won an election
in New Jersey,

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:26.226
where Governor Phil Murphy
became the first Democrat

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:28.128
to win reelection
since the 1970s.

00:00:28.128 --> 00:00:31.698
So of course, on cue, the usual
suspects are once again

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:33.166
claiming there was fraud.

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:37.804
-In New Jersey, I -- Now,
the guy hasn´t conceded, right?

00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:39.372
Because we´re going
to do a big foren--

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.474
I think they´re going
to do a big audit

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:43.176
is what I´ve been hearing
on the ground

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:48.081
because these votes
came in, 40,000 votes,

00:00:48.081 --> 00:00:49.482
they´re not real.

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:50.550
They´re not real.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:51.985
We´ve been getting flood.

00:00:51.985 --> 00:00:55.388
I´ve been getting floods of
texts on my phone

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:57.991
and e-mails going,
"They did it again.

00:00:57.991 --> 00:00:59.726
They did it in New Jersey."

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:02.896
Now remember,
they still cheated in Virginia,

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:04.764
even though the Republican won.

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:07.400
But for some reason there,

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.803
they didn´t do the big jump
in the middle of the night.

00:01:09.803 --> 00:01:12.572
Maybe it would have been
too obvious to steal two horses

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.673
at the same time.

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:15.842
You know, I don´t know.

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.577
-Lindell really comes to you
with the energy

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:20.313
of a sugared-up kid on Halloween
telling you about his day.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.782
"We saw a ghost and a skeleton,
and then there was --

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:24.951
Wait, wait, another ghost
and Kevin was there,

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:26.419
but he fell down and cried,

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:29.522
Everybody, we got so much
candy!"

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:31.558
But, okay, a couple of things.

00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:33.026
First of all,
thanks for clearing up

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:36.196
that you´ve been getting flooded
with texts on your phone,

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:39.365
you know, as opposed to texts
that you get in the mail

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:41.234
or the ones you can
get it Marshalls

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:42.235
and put up on your wall.

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:45.071
Second, these guys love audits,

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:48.174
not to be confused with "aw
dis," which is what people say

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:49.843
when Mike Lindell
enters a room.

00:01:49.843 --> 00:01:52.745
"Aw, dis ass[bleep]."

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:56.116
"I thought two horses
dumped ballots in the road,

00:01:56.116 --> 00:02:00.186
but it was just
regular horse dumps."

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:02.055
Also, what do you mean
they cheated in Virginia,

00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:03.022
but not enough to win?

00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:04.357
Why would they do that?

00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:06.893
That would be like if the Jets
hacked the scoreboard

00:02:06.893 --> 00:02:09.629
so instead of losing to
the Colts 45-30 last Thursday,

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:12.165
they lost 45-32.

00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:13.433
And that´s right,
this is important.

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:16.102
The Jets did lose on Thursday,
which stopped them

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:17.570
from having
a two-game win streak,

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.607
which is good for "Late Night"

00:02:20.607 --> 00:02:24.944
because we need easy punch lines
about the Jets sucking.

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:26.613
Though, it is bad for our crew,
almost all of whom

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:28.248
are Jets fans,
and that´s not by accident.

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:29.782
If you want to surround yourself
with loyal people

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:32.719
who aren´t going to bail
when things get tough,

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:34.521
get people who are still
sticking with the Jets.

00:02:34.521 --> 00:02:37.223
They are so easy to please.

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:39.058
For crew snack yesterday,

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:41.094
we just put out
loose slices of ham,

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:42.228
and I heard one of them say,

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:44.497
"Still better
than Mark Sanchez."

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:48.768
Anyway, we´ve long known
from all the court cases

00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:50.837
the lack of evidence,
and, you know, reality

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:52.105
that the people
who keep insisting

00:02:52.105 --> 00:02:54.307
there was widespread voter fraud
in the 2020 election

00:02:54.307 --> 00:02:56.042
are unhinged maniacs and liars.

00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:57.977
But now,
thanks to a new court case,

00:02:57.977 --> 00:03:00.880
we know from their own words
that they knew

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.215
what they were saying
might not be true

00:03:02.215 --> 00:03:04.117
because in a newly
released deposition,

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:05.585
former Trump lawyer
Rudy Giuliani

00:03:05.585 --> 00:03:08.922
essentially admitted he had
no evidence for his voter fraud

00:03:08.922 --> 00:03:11.958
claims because he didn´t have
time to verify them.

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:14.394
-New video exclusive to CNN
shows Donald Trump´s

00:03:14.394 --> 00:03:17.797
allies saying under oath that
they put very little effort

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:20.466
into verifying debunked claims
of election fraud

00:03:20.466 --> 00:03:23.036
before spreading them
on the national stage.

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:27.640
-Before the press conference,

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.075
I was told about it.

00:03:29.075 --> 00:03:33.046
Sometimes I go and look myself
on line when stuff comes up.

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:34.581
This time I don´t have
the time to do it.

00:03:34.581 --> 00:03:38.952
It´s not my job in
a fast-moving case to go out

00:03:38.952 --> 00:03:42.255
and investigate every piece
of evidence that´s given to me.

00:03:42.255 --> 00:03:44.557
-No, of course not.
That´s what lawyers are for.

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:48.094
As everyone knows, you´re just
the events coordinator

00:03:48.094 --> 00:03:49.295
for a landscaping company.

00:03:49.295 --> 00:03:52.098
Oh, Rudy. Rudy, sweet Rudy,
that is your job.

00:03:52.098 --> 00:03:53.433
I mean, it was supposed
to be your job.

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:55.668
Although in fairness,
Rudy looks less like a guy

00:03:55.668 --> 00:03:56.903
who would investigate a crime

00:03:56.903 --> 00:03:58.938
and more like the guy
sitting on a park bench

00:03:58.938 --> 00:04:01.341
who just tells the cops
what they´re doing is wrong.

00:04:01.341 --> 00:04:03.276
"You think the pickpocket
went that way?

00:04:03.276 --> 00:04:05.845
Well, then best of luck to you.

00:04:05.845 --> 00:04:06.913
If I were the pickpocket,

00:04:06.913 --> 00:04:08.114
I´d sit right here
on this bench.

00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:10.917
Whoa, what´s with the cuffs?"

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:13.286
And it doesn´t surprise me
that he didn´t do any vetting

00:04:13.286 --> 00:04:15.054
right before
his infamous press conference

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:16.856
with fellow crazy person
Sidney Powell

00:04:16.856 --> 00:04:18.558
since during that
press conference,

00:04:18.558 --> 00:04:20.360
he was sweating like a guy
who knew his facts

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:22.862
might not be rock solid.

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:25.265
My man is perspiring
like he just bet his life

00:04:25.265 --> 00:04:29.135
savings on a horse
called The Three-Legged Rocket.

00:04:29.135 --> 00:04:31.237
You really don´t think it´s
your job to verify information

00:04:31.237 --> 00:04:32.505
before you announce it
to the world?

00:04:32.505 --> 00:04:34.407
Is this how you operated
when you were mayor?

00:04:34.407 --> 00:04:36.209
"Thank you for coming to this
press conference, everyone.

00:04:36.209 --> 00:04:38.177
I have huge news
for the city of New York.

00:04:38.177 --> 00:04:40.413
Today, I received an e-mail
with the subject line

00:04:40.413 --> 00:04:43.149
´FWD: FWD: FWD:
Free Boner Pills for Life!´

00:04:43.149 --> 00:04:45.685
And that´s not just for me,

00:04:45.685 --> 00:04:47.353
it´s the life
of this entire city.

00:04:47.353 --> 00:04:48.955
And in return, all I had to do

00:04:48.955 --> 00:04:50.957
was give them
our Social Security numbers,

00:04:50.957 --> 00:04:53.059
but only the first nine digits."

00:04:53.059 --> 00:04:54.661
Rudy seems so tired
in that deposition.

00:04:54.661 --> 00:04:55.862
And I get it.

00:04:55.862 --> 00:04:56.963
It´s exhausting just watching

00:04:56.963 --> 00:04:58.298
someone be that crazy.

00:04:58.298 --> 00:05:00.433
I can´t imagine what it´s like
to live a day to day.

00:05:00.433 --> 00:05:02.035
That´s the thing about
the modern Republican Party.

00:05:02.035 --> 00:05:03.603
They just make
everything exhausting.

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:06.472
It´s so hard to follow
their insane voter fraud claims

00:05:06.472 --> 00:05:08.241
or their latest
culture war obsessions.

00:05:08.241 --> 00:05:11.244
Every day, it seems like we have
to endure one dumb culture war

00:05:11.244 --> 00:05:12.679
controversy after another.

00:05:12.679 --> 00:05:14.814
And that´s before we even
get to the war on Christmas

00:05:14.814 --> 00:05:16.482
because, you know, it´s coming.

00:05:16.482 --> 00:05:18.117
When Trump was president,

00:05:18.117 --> 00:05:19.652
they claim Christmas was saved,

00:05:19.652 --> 00:05:21.154
but now the Democrats
are in charge again.

00:05:21.154 --> 00:05:23.089
You know they´re going to find
some school district

00:05:23.089 --> 00:05:25.625
somewhere that calls them
"holiday decorations"

00:05:25.625 --> 00:05:27.060
instead of
Christmas decorations.

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:28.928
And Jeanine Pirro is going
to spend the entire hour

00:05:28.928 --> 00:05:33.633
on her show rage guzzling
two bottles of Charles Shaw.

00:05:33.633 --> 00:05:35.068
She probably calls them Chuck.

00:05:35.068 --> 00:05:38.237
And while we´re on the subject
we brought up for no reason,

00:05:38.237 --> 00:05:40.340
I´m not pro war on Christmas,

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:41.941
but I wouldn´t mind negotiating
a peace treaty

00:05:41.941 --> 00:05:43.943
that gets it to stick
to reasonable calendar borders.

00:05:43.943 --> 00:05:46.179
I mean, it´s encroaching
on the other holidays.

00:05:46.179 --> 00:05:47.513
There are people out there
who start putting up

00:05:47.513 --> 00:05:50.450
Christmas decorations
the day after Halloween.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.819
The other day
I saw an animatronic skeleton

00:05:52.819 --> 00:05:55.121
on someone´s porch
wearing a Santa hat,

00:05:55.121 --> 00:05:58.257
and now my kids think
Santa is dead.

00:05:58.257 --> 00:06:01.060
[ Laughter ]

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:01.894
Anyway.

00:06:01.894 --> 00:06:02.729
Oh, which reminds me

00:06:02.729 --> 00:06:03.796
tonight´s "Closer Look"

00:06:03.796 --> 00:06:05.832
is brought to you
by the word "Anyway."

00:06:05.832 --> 00:06:07.934
Need a way back
to the political stuff

00:06:07.934 --> 00:06:09.102
after a long tangent?

00:06:09.102 --> 00:06:10.970
Try "anyway."

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:13.539
[ Laughter ]

00:06:13.539 --> 00:06:16.909
Anyway, we had to endure one
nauseatingly stupid culture

00:06:16.909 --> 00:06:19.479
war controversy after another,
like when conservatives started

00:06:19.479 --> 00:06:20.980
whining about
Potato Head pronouns

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:23.716
or said Joe Biden was going
to steal your hamburgers.

00:06:23.716 --> 00:06:26.119
And when they lost their minds
over the Dr. Seuss estate

00:06:26.119 --> 00:06:28.654
voluntarily pulling
a few books from publication

00:06:28.654 --> 00:06:29.922
that no one cared about anyway.

00:06:29.922 --> 00:06:31.491
-Say goodbye to your burgers

00:06:31.491 --> 00:06:34.394
if you want to sign up
for the Biden climate agenda.

00:06:34.394 --> 00:06:36.529
-Americans would have to
cut red meat consumption

00:06:36.529 --> 00:06:38.631
by a whopping 90%.

00:06:38.631 --> 00:06:41.534
-He wants to cut out 90%

00:06:41.534 --> 00:06:43.302
of the red meat
that you all eat.

00:06:43.302 --> 00:06:45.371
-First, they outlaw Dr. Seuss,

00:06:45.371 --> 00:06:47.006
and now they want to tell us
what to say.

00:06:47.006 --> 00:06:49.675
-Look out, Mr. Potato Head,
you´re next.

00:06:49.675 --> 00:06:51.511
-They want to cancel
the Muppets.

00:06:51.511 --> 00:06:53.846
They want to cancel
Mr. and Mrs. Potato Head.

00:06:53.846 --> 00:06:55.415
-You see, last week
they tried to cancel

00:06:55.415 --> 00:06:57.116
Kermit the Frog
and Mr. Potato Head?

00:06:57.116 --> 00:06:59.051
You see that?
-This week alone,

00:06:59.051 --> 00:07:01.587
they canceled Mr. Potato Head.

00:07:01.587 --> 00:07:05.057
You know, this week alone,
they canceled the Muppets.

00:07:05.057 --> 00:07:07.427
You know, they´re canceling
Dr. Seuss.

00:07:07.427 --> 00:07:09.495
-Alright. First of all,
Mr. Potato Head isn´t canceled.

00:07:09.495 --> 00:07:10.863
He was just on TV.

00:07:10.863 --> 00:07:11.931
Oh!

00:07:11.931 --> 00:07:15.668
[ Laughter ]

00:07:15.668 --> 00:07:16.602
Whoa, hold on a second.

00:07:16.602 --> 00:07:18.504
Can´t we change his mouth?

00:07:18.504 --> 00:07:19.939
Okay.

00:07:19.939 --> 00:07:21.607
[ Laughter ]

00:07:21.607 --> 00:07:24.010
Horrifying, but also
a little bit better.

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:26.145
Obviously, none of that stuff
was canceled or outlawed,

00:07:26.145 --> 00:07:27.847
but they have to keep
the culture wars burning

00:07:27.847 --> 00:07:29.215
because they have nothing else
to talk about.

00:07:29.215 --> 00:07:30.783
So every week
it´s something new.

00:07:30.783 --> 00:07:32.652
Potato Head, Dr. Seuss,
"Looney Tunes."

00:07:32.652 --> 00:07:35.321
Next, they´re going to claim the
left is canceling Sandra Boynton

00:07:35.321 --> 00:07:38.591
because she refused
to include the hippopotamus

00:07:38.591 --> 00:07:40.126
and now the hippos are so mad

00:07:40.126 --> 00:07:44.130
they´re showing up to school
board meetings going berserk.

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:46.365
Any Sandra Boynton fans
in the house?!

00:07:46.365 --> 00:07:48.100
[ Scattered
cheers and applause ]

00:07:49.635 --> 00:07:52.472
[ Laughter ]

00:07:55.041 --> 00:07:57.743
Wish I had a way out of this.
Oh, I do.

00:07:57.743 --> 00:07:59.679
Anyway...

00:07:59.679 --> 00:08:01.981
And now, like clockwork,
the right has come up

00:08:01.981 --> 00:08:04.517
with their next culture war
target -- Big Bird.

00:08:04.517 --> 00:08:07.119
-Big Bird and the backlash that
the "Sesame Street" character

00:08:07.119 --> 00:08:09.088
is getting from
some Republicans

00:08:09.088 --> 00:08:11.557
after tweeting he got the COVID
shot over the weekend.

00:08:11.557 --> 00:08:13.226
-The "Sesame Street" character,

00:08:13.226 --> 00:08:15.328
who is six years old
on the show,

00:08:15.328 --> 00:08:16.963
posted about getting the vaccine

00:08:16.963 --> 00:08:18.564
after the Pfizer shot
was approved

00:08:18.564 --> 00:08:20.132
for kids as young as five.

00:08:20.132 --> 00:08:22.168
-Big Bird is literally hawking

00:08:22.168 --> 00:08:24.403
an unnecessary vaccine
for children.

00:08:24.403 --> 00:08:26.639
Big Bird is literally
encouraging children

00:08:26.639 --> 00:08:29.175
to take a vaccine scientifically
that they do not need.

00:08:29.175 --> 00:08:31.644
-A lot of propaganda
about the vaccines

00:08:31.644 --> 00:08:33.145
being not directed
to the parents,

00:08:33.145 --> 00:08:36.382
not information given to parents
so they can make that decision,

00:08:36.382 --> 00:08:39.051
but really getting it
directly to the kids

00:08:39.051 --> 00:08:43.489
in some really creepy ways,
including "Sesame Street."

00:08:43.489 --> 00:08:46.459
-Texas Senator Ted Cruz
responded to Big Bird´s tweet,

00:08:46.459 --> 00:08:49.862
saying, "Government propaganda
for your five year old."

00:08:49.862 --> 00:08:51.063
-Oh, my God. So in the end,

00:08:51.063 --> 00:08:53.132
it turns out
they were the ones who

00:08:53.132 --> 00:08:55.501
-...canceled The Muppets.
[ Echoing ]

00:08:55.501 --> 00:08:57.336
[ Sinister music playing ]

00:08:57.336 --> 00:09:04.343
♫♫

00:09:04.343 --> 00:09:09.148
-But seriously [laughs] I have
to admit, it´s a tough one.

00:09:09.148 --> 00:09:10.349
I mean,
who are you going to side with?

00:09:10.349 --> 00:09:12.351
The beloved
and iconic children´s character

00:09:12.351 --> 00:09:14.387
widely celebrated
for over half a century

00:09:14.387 --> 00:09:16.022
by people of all ages
and backgrounds

00:09:16.022 --> 00:09:18.991
from all parts of the world,
or a widely disliked

00:09:18.991 --> 00:09:21.193
wannabe werewolf with
the charm of a serial killer

00:09:21.193 --> 00:09:23.596
and the voice of a dying barn
owl who was once called

00:09:23.596 --> 00:09:27.066
"Lucifer in the flesh"
by one of his fellow Republicans

00:09:27.066 --> 00:09:28.367
after another fellow Republican

00:09:28.367 --> 00:09:30.136
joked he was so unpopular
you could murder him

00:09:30.136 --> 00:09:31.404
and get away with it?

00:09:31.404 --> 00:09:34.307
Uh...could be either --
I don´t know.

00:09:34.307 --> 00:09:36.208
These people´s brains
are so weird.

00:09:36.208 --> 00:09:37.910
They wake up in the morning
and think it´s a good idea

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:39.078
to go to war with Big Bird.

00:09:39.078 --> 00:09:40.479
Next, they´re
going to claim Moderna

00:09:40.479 --> 00:09:42.548
is how the Swedish Chef
says "my dinner."

00:09:42.548 --> 00:09:46.319
[ Laughter ]

00:09:46.319 --> 00:09:47.687
Oh, I´m going to do it.

00:09:47.687 --> 00:09:51.057
[ Laughter ]

00:09:52.959 --> 00:09:54.827
[ Clears throat ]

00:09:54.827 --> 00:09:57.263
"Hey, Swedish Chef,
what are you doing?"

00:09:57.263 --> 00:10:00.166
"I´m-a makin´ moderna."

00:10:00.166 --> 00:10:01.267
And that -- Yeah, yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:01.267 --> 00:10:04.437
No, I mean, can´t --

00:10:04.437 --> 00:10:07.173
Can´t stop that.

00:10:07.173 --> 00:10:10.977
And that´s today´s
topical joke for kids.

00:10:10.977 --> 00:10:13.846
